@startuml
title DRIS系统总体组件图
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei

actor "用户/答辩教师" as User
rectangle "DRIS Frontend\nVue3 + Vite" as Frontend
rectangle "DeepResearch Orchestrator\nPlanner + Executor + Report" as Orchestrator
rectangle "DRIS MCP Server\nMCP Tools / Resources / Prompts" as Mcp
rectangle "Enterprise Backend V2\nSpring Boot REST API" as Backend
rectangle "Auth Center\nJWT / OAuth-like Token" as Auth
rectangle "DRIS Java SDK Next\nIdentifier Kernel" as Sdk
rectangle "DRIRP Java SDK\nProtocol / Transport / Auth" as Drirp
database "MySQL / Object Storage\n业务数据与资源" as DataStore

User --> Frontend : 页面访问/研究请求
Frontend --> Orchestrator : /api/research/run\n/api/research/stream
Frontend --> Auth : register/login/userinfo
Orchestrator --> Mcp : MCP Streamable HTTP
Mcp --> Backend : REST调用
Backend --> Auth : 公钥获取/Token校验
Backend --> Sdk : 标识内核调用
Backend --> Drirp : 协议/分布式调用
Backend --> DataStore : 元数据/审计/资源

note right of Mcp
  统一暴露工具:
  resolve/search/audit/routes
end note

note right of Orchestrator
  研究流程:
  规划 -> 工具调用 -> 报告生成
end note
@enduml
